  "updated_at": "2026-04-08",
  "bio": "Immerse yourself in the creative oasis of Space Tattoo Duisburg, where intricate finelines, whimsical watercolors, and expressive sketches turn skin into canvas. Nestled in the heart of Duisburg, Germany at Friedrich-Alfred-Str 39, this studio celebrates the art of ink with a special affection for comic-inspired designs, elegant black and grey shades, and a diverse palette that ranges from vibrant trash polka to serene mandalas. Step in to transform your vision into an everlasting work of art, punctuated by precision, color, and imagination.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Duisburg, North-rhine-westphalia, Germany"
}